msgid "Integrate more then 30+ international payment methods in your WooCommerce webshop. Simply enable them into your WooCommerce webshop with the Buckaroo Payments plugin.</br>Please go to the <a href=\"https://plaza.buckaroo.nl/Configuration/Website/Index/\">signup page</a> to create a Buckaroo account and start receiving payments.</br>Contact <a href=\"mailto:support@buckaroo.nl\">support@buckaroo.nl</a> if you have any questions about this plugin."
